{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/266e834873311eff0c8da40f5aed1da9.poster.avif?t=1771096889\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/266e834873311eff0c8da40f5aed1da9.webm?t=1771096889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/266e834873311eff0c8da40f5aed1da9.mp4?t=1771096889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <strong>Horse Runner DX</strong>, a fast-paced pixel art platformer with a unique herd-building mechanic. Build a growing herd of horses, combine their power-ups, and take on fun challenges through sunny summer landscapes. Plan your herd wisely, unlock new horses, and keep the action running!</p><br><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Simple &amp; Tight Controls</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/c24d80df74887065007da15c7c18b061.poster.avif?t=1771096889\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/c24d80df74887065007da15c7c18b061.webm?t=1771096889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/c24d80df74887065007da15c7c18b061.mp4?t=1771096889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The simple one-button controls are super accessible and let you perform perfectly timed jumps. You control the lead horse, all other horses follow you automatically.</p><br><strong>\ud83c\udfb2 Herd-Building</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/e094f7b3e619d7edb8b24a6f5d7d30d6.poster.avif?t=1771096889\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/e094f7b3e619d7edb8b24a6f5d7d30d6.webm?t=1771096889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/e094f7b3e619d7edb8b24a6f5d7d30d6.mp4?t=1771096889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each level, choose an additional horse to join your herd. Each horse functions like an extra life and has a specific power-up that changes the gameplay.</p><br><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Tricky Challenges</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/fd4b01dc8fd4e592b8c08d065ea43811.poster.avif?t=1771096889\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/fd4b01dc8fd4e592b8c08d065ea43811.webm?t=1771096889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/fd4b01dc8fd4e592b8c08d065ea43811.mp4?t=1771096889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to earn rewards and push your platforming and strategy skills to the limit. At first the challenges are simple and easy to complete, later ones require good planning.</p><br><strong>\ud83c\udf33 Cute Pixel Art Graphics</strong><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/1f9e7492e6a489fc27e9fde463f42ac6.poster.avif?t=1771096889\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2955320/extras/1f9e7492e6a489fc27e9fde463f42ac6.webm?t=1771096889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy colorful, pixel-perfect graphics, inspired by classic 16-bit games. All graphics are hand-drawn with love to detail, bringing the vibrant landscapes to life and making every run a joy.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Off to Adventure!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955320/fa1e5dbd18b8817cfcdbb48ade02b9f32766cace.jpg"},{"name":"First Signs of Sweat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955320/cd7a3bd317322412fb58c2af2f6b0ef9a7f6a53f.jpg"},{"name":"Mild Panic Mode","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955320/a2af44e6f210ffc54363b8741171a4ed18f7b05a.jpg"},{"name":"This Is Fine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955320/2b16c11dd31fe16663e20b495e28e40206fef541.jpg"},{"name":"Seasoned Adventurer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955320/0ae2333ecbdd807f0a676949118bdde61b844853.jpg"},{"name":"Question Answered","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955320/b548d86d5a010212a6b66d7861c793511be82a3c.jpg"},{"name":"A Hundred Levels Later","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955320/d5b26dcc73542e597e3560ed9a16168f57da7020.jpg"},{"name":"No Horse Left Behind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955320/388c848bc4c037f960889bbf4c79964c2a0c25b6.jpg"},{"name":"Mane Character","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2955320/21288663b15e73ccb93d904524b1b1b26fddc98b.jpg"},{